<title>USA: Regal Hotel offers to buy Aircoa shares.</title>
<headline>Regal Hotel offers to buy Aircoa shares.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regal Hotel Management Inc said it offered to buy the remainder of Aircoa Hotel Partners LP's Class A and and B shares it doesn't own for $2.35 per A share and $16 per B share.</p>
<p>Regal owns about 71 percent -- or 3,794,646 -- of Aircoa's Class A shares and 94 percent -- or 888,746 -- of its Class B shares.</p>
<p>Regal said the companies haven't yet determined the terms of the transaction. It also said any transaction it would pay for with available funds, rather than through bank loans.</p>
</text>
